+</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
+<header class="mast"><b>Chloe’s Future Archive</b><span>Field experiment · September 2026</span><a href="./">All exhibits ↗</a></header>
+<main><section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">A small instrument for large time</div><h1>The Hundred-Year <em>Echo</em></h1><p class="lede">Sort the urgent, the lovely, and the lasting. Then send one good thing farther than your calendar can see.</p></div><figure class="art"><img src="hundred-year-echo-hero.webp" alt="Painted clockwork errands giving way to a cedar tree, family table, learning, prayer, and golden rings"></figure></section>
+<div class="rule"></div><section class="brief"><div><h2>Time is a ruthless editor.</h2><div class="stamp">ARCHIVE TEST<br>№ 100</div></div><p>Matthew Kelly’s line, quoted by Jon, asks how much of our busyness will mean anything a century from now. This isn’t a productivity score. It’s a playful change of scale: six ordinary activities, four shelves in time, and no single correct answer.</p></section>
+<section class="station"><div class="station-head"><div><div class="kicker" style="color:var(--gold)">Part I · The sorting room</div><h2>Where does this echo end?</h2></div><div class="counter"><span id="count">0</span>/6<small>items archived</small></div></div><div class="workbench"><article class="card" id="card" data-no="01" aria-live="polite"><div><div class="glyph" id="glyph">✦</div><h3 id="activity">Loading…</h3></div><p>No answer key. Choose the horizon that feels honest today.</p></article><div class="bins">
+<button class="bin" data-years="1"><span>Shelf A · tonight</span><strong>Gone by supper</strong><b>·</b></button><button class="bin" data-years="18"><span>Shelf B · one season</span><strong>Still matters next spring</strong><b>)))</b></button><button class="bin" data-years="58"><span>Shelf C · one lifetime</span><strong>Echoes after I’m gone</strong><b>)))))</b></button><button class="bin" data-years="100"><span>Shelf D · one century</span><strong>Could matter in 100 years</strong><b>))))))))</b></button>
+</div></div><div class="meter"><label>Current echo horizon</label><div class="track"><i></i></div></div></section>
+<section class="reflect"><blockquote>Not everything must last. A cup of tea may vanish and still be <em>worth having.</em></blockquote><div class="prompt"><label for="note">Part II · One thing worth sending forward</label><textarea id="note" maxlength="180" placeholder="A tradition, kindness, skill, story, prayer, repair…"></textarea><button class="seal" id="seal">Seal in the future archive</button></div></section>
+<section class="receipt" id="receipt" aria-live="polite"><div class="kicker">Archive receipt · accepted</div><h2>A note to 2126</h2><div class="chosen" id="chosen"></div><small id="summary"></small></section></main>
+<footer><div class="source">Inspired by Jon’s <a href="https://cooltoolsforcatholics.blogspot.com/2005/01/rhythm-of-life-by-matthew-kelly.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">“The Rhythm of Life by Matthew Kelly”</a>, especially its question about what our busyness will mean a hundred years from now.</div><div>Made for reflection, not judgement.<br>Nothing leaves this page.</div></footer></div>
+<script>
+const pool=[['Clear the last twelve notifications','▤'],['Teach a child the family recipe','♨'],['Repair a friendship after a sharp word','↝'],['Buy the slightly better charging cable','⌁'],['Write down a story only your family knows','✎'],['Sit beside someone who is lonely','◒'],['Perfect the spacing on one tiny button','⌘'],['Plant a tree you may never sit beneath','♣'],['Pray faithfully for someone by name','✦'],['Make a ridiculous joke at breakfast','☀'],['Keep a promise when nobody checks','◇'],['Build a useful thing and give it away','⚒']].sort(()=>crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0]/4294967296-.5).slice(0,6);let step=0,total=0;const card=document.querySelector('#card'),activity=document.querySelector('#activity'),glyph=document.querySelector('#glyph');
+function show(){if(step===6){activity.textContent='The shelves are full.';glyph.textContent='✓';card.dataset.no='—';document.querySelectorAll('.bin').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=true;b.style.opacity=.35});document.querySelector('.reflect').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});return}activity.textContent=pool[step][0];glyph.textContent=pool[step][1];card.dataset.no=String(step+1).padStart(2,'0');card.style.animation='none';requestAnimationFrame(()=>card.style.animation='deal .4s both')}
+document.querySelectorAll('.bin').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{total+=+b.dataset.years;step++;document.querySelector('#count').textContent=step;document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--ring',Math.round(total/step));b.classList.remove('flash');void b.offsetWidth;b.classList.add('flash');setTimeout(show,230)});
+document.querySelector('#seal').onclick=()=>{const note=document.querySelector('#note').value.trim(),avg=step?Math.round(total/step):0,r=document.querySelector('#receipt');document.querySelector('#chosen').textContent=note||'I will leave one small place kinder than I found it.';document.querySelector('#summary').textContent=step?'Your choices reached an average horizon of '+avg+' years. Not a grade; simply the distance from which you looked back.':'You skipped the measuring and kept the promise. The archive respects that.';r.classList.add('show');r.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'})};show();
+</script></body></html>